{"availability":"available","full":"weiqi-kids/vuko.life","name":"vuko.life","description":"Free, open-source web app: binaural beats that adapt to your breathing in real time for sleep, focus & meditation. Runs in your browser, no signup.","category":"Developer tools","language":"HTML","stars":1,"forks":0,"created":"2025-06-16T23:53:56Z","updated":"2026-10-17T03:10:14Z","license":"MIT","branch":"main","homepage":"https://www.vuko.life","topics":["binaural-beats","brainwave-entrainment","breathing","browser-app","focus","free","javascript","meditation","mental-health","mindfulness","no-signup","open-source","privacy","pwa","relaxation","sleep","stress-relief","web-audio","webaudio-api"],"demo":"https://www.vuko.life/","color":"#302e55","ink":"#dbd2ff","lastCheckedAt":"2026-10-18T11:32:01.496Z","lastAttemptAt":"2026-10-18T11:32:01.496Z","lastAvailableAt":"2026-10-18T11:32:01.496Z","metrics":[{"at":"2026-10-05T19:23:18.237Z","stars":0,"forks":0},{"at":"2026-10-07T20:13:46.765Z","stars":0,"forks":0},{"at":"2026-10-09T22:05:02.095Z","stars":0,"forks":0},{"at":"2026-10-11T19:51:06.320Z","stars":0,"forks":0},{"at":"2026-10-17T21:13:46.371Z","stars":1,"forks":0},{"at":"2026-10-18T11:32:01.496Z","stars":1,"forks":0}],"technologies":[],"overview":{"kind":"readme","version":1,"paragraphs":["Free, open-source, no signup, no install. Vuko generates binaural beats with the Web Audio API and — if you allow microphone access — listens to your breathing rhythm and adapts the beat frequency to it in real time. Everything runs locally in your browser; no audio ever leaves your device.","Every binaural beats app plays a fixed frequency at you. Vuko closes the loop: it detects your breathing through the microphone and nudges the beat frequency along with you — slowing as you slow down. Pick a target state and Vuko guides you there:","Plus a built-in library of ambient tracks with semantic search — type what you feel like (\"rain on a tent\", \"temple bells\") and it finds matching musi